# Copy this file to `.env.local` and fill in the key, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com — enter the address you want
# submissions delivered to and they email you the key. No account required.
#
# Both the contact form (/contact) and the newsletter signup (/coming-soon)
# use this. Until it is set, both forms tell the visitor to email us directly
# instead of silently failing.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_ is required: this is a static export, so the value is inlined
# into the client bundle at build time. Web3Forms access keys are designed to
# be public and only ever deliver to the registered address.

NEXT_PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
